        {
          "from": "Twi ketewa [kɪtɪwa] 'small'",
          "to": "Fante [kɪʦɪkɪʦɪ]",
          "note": "/ts/ is written ⟨ts⟩ in Fante. It is a separate phoneme in subdialects that keep it apart from /t/ and an allophone of /t/ in the others."
